Description: Provides low-level bindings to 'libmdbx', a compact and fast
    transactional key-value store built on memory-mapped files
    (<https://libmdbx.dqdkfa.ru/>). Database environments, transactions,
    and byte-oriented read and write operations are exposed directly. The
    'libmdbx' sources are bundled and compiled into the package, so no
    system library installation is required.
